These normalized reports were regenerated from physical copies of the configured
consumer fixture with `consumer-overlay.yml`, using exact-source local CLIs:
main `073148c2d` and PR head `edb31fdf0`. Both commands exited 1. Main has
one transaction-only finding; the PR has one query finding. The pinned report
hashes and CLI artifact hashes are in `/tmp/nm2022-v3-local-consumer-evidence.json`
for local review, and the exact expected report hashes are in `pair.json`.

These files test the preflight policy. They are untimed local semantic evidence,
not ARM timing results or a substitute for the workflow's independently frozen
release CLIs. The workflow repeats the reports from those release CLIs and fails
if either output, exit status, or source pair differs.
